<li>Once installed, WARP will launch automatically and appear in your system tray.</li>
<li>Click Next and accept Cloudflare's Privacy Policy.</li>
<li>Launch Cloudflare on your device.</li>
When prompted to sign in, enter your full angstorm-usa.com email address.</li>
<li>For the Location or gateway dropdown, select AAC-Texas Gateway.</li>
