<h2>How to remove the application</h2>
<ul>
<li>Select the Start menu and search for Settings. You can also press Win + I.</li>
<li>Select Apps &gt; App &amp; Features.</li>
<li>Scroll down to Cloudflare WARP and select Uninstall.</li>
